I removed the enrichment fetch and the `http-client` import. The node's `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/inference-llm@0.1.0`, and the linker rejects anything else. The approved extension isn't part of the actual grant, so the body can't make that call. If the grant is updated to include `http-client`, the fetch can go back in. The node's output is unchanged either way, because the earlier fetch result was discarded.

